# 自动识别文本文件并归一换行符 / Normalize line endings for text files
* text=auto eol=lf

# CSV 档案表：保留 UTF-8 BOM（中文 Excel 识别），换行按 CRLF
# CSV archive exports keep the UTF-8 BOM for Chinese Excel; CRLF line endings.
*.csv text eol=crlf working-tree-encoding=UTF-8

# 二进制资源不做换行归一 / Binary assets are left untouched
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.docx binary
*.xlsx binary
*.pdf binary
